missing_entity.description:
The entity `{entity_id}` does not exist in Home Assistant, but is referenced by these Ambience scenes in the {scope}:
{scenes}

A condition referencing it will never match; an action targeting it will fail silently. Fix the entity id in the Ambience editor or remove the reference. This message clears automatically once the entity exists.

action_overlap.description:
The entity `{entity_id}` is controlled by more than one Ambience category/scope group:
{groups}

Each group is an independent control loop with its own state, so they can fight over this entity and produce stale or no-op applies. Consider moving it into a single group. This message clears automatically once the overlap is resolved.
